OL,3,GNEWSAHow Karl Bushby battled English
OL,4,AChannel doubts
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish adventurer Karl Bushby says he
OL,7,Fbattled self-doubt to complete a
OL,8,Fgruelling swim across the English
OL,9,FChannel with no training - the final,
OL,10,Fmajor hurdle on his 28-year walk across
OL,11,Fthe world.
OL,13,FThe former paratrooper set off from
OL,14,FChile, South America, on 1 November
OL,15,F1998 with two self-imposed rules - not
OL,16,Fto use transport to advance and not to
OL,17,Freturn home to Hull until the journey
OL,18,Fis complete.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
