OL,3,GNEWSAHow Karl Bushby battled English
OL,4,AChannel doubts
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, he announced he had reached
OL,7,FDover, where he was welcomed by family
OL,8,Fafter three days at sea, including 20
OL,9,Fhours in the water between rests.
OL,11,FHe said: "Getting in the water that
OL,12,Ffirst day, I thought 'have I taken too
OL,13,Fmuch of a bite here? But you dig deep.
OL,14,FKeep on keeping on. You find a rhythm."
